lign="top" charoff="50">&#x0003e;0.999</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;(&#x0002b;)</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">4</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">2</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote1"><label>a</label><p><italic>&#x003c7;</italic><sup>2</sup> test, <italic>P</italic>-value&#x0003d;0.0191, Fisher's exact test, <italic>P</italic>-value&#x0003d;0.0573.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>